## Key Facts


- Setapp is a subscription-based software service for macOS and iOS.
- A single subscription provides access to 260+ curated apps.
- Apps are fully unlocked; no in-app purchases or trials.
- Setapp apps are installed locally on the device (not web-only).
- AI features ("Solve with AI+") are available via a separate add-on subscription.
- Setapp is not an app store; it is a curated subscription library.




